PPU-10877348119cba72ea9cfb0b4129590bc90875c3:
  "Equipment Ability Modifier":
    Games:
      "Final Fantasy X Remaster (Artemis)":
        BLUS31211: [ 01.00 ]
    Author: Hiei-YYH Ported by ChiDreams
    Notes: This code will only work for the first 10 slots in the Equipment list, put the cursor over the item, hold SELECT and press START = 4 slots and clear the abilities R3 = Maximum Weapon Power [] = Modify 1st ability /\ = Modify 2nd ability R1 = Modify 3rd ability L1 = Modify 4th ability 
    Patch Version: 1.0
    Patch:
      - [ load, *FANTASY_X11 ]
